<p>It's neat, although if I'm being honest, I feel as though it's just another story of an angry spirit possessing an object. Not that it can't be done but that it's been done a lot already. There needs to be something particularly unique about what it does, because just attacking anyone who happens by at some particular moment is generally what ghosts do in your everyday ghost story.</p>
<p>I think what you need is something that makes the actions of the vehicle unique. For instances, what is it like during daylight hours? I think there's some room to play with it there.</p>

